::  name       tablecloth catalog capacity
::  shape      artifacts -- int (@u32), bound 32
::  invariant  one cloth names at most thirty-two artifacts, so a whole catalog is held in memory
::  example    32
::  readers    Tablecloth - Mantra beading - Glow Tend - shape museum
::  nib        tablecloth-v1 at 20260812.142132
::
::  The first Tablecloth pedestal in this room, and the vane's first Glow desk of any kind.
::  Names max_artifacts from brushstroke/tablecloth.rye, whose Catalog binds a human name to a
::  content address held in mantra/beading.rye's shared BeadStore -- the same bytes stored once
::  and named many times. Pedestal only: Rye still owns Catalog, Entry, and every ClothError
::  refusal path, and this desk names one number beside them.
+$  tablecloth-catalog-capacity-shape
  $:  artifacts=@u32
  ==
